      },
      "text": "Every drawing is a scene with a name and its \nown address, like kurviq.com/roadmap.\n\n• Switch scenes in the Scenes sidebar: click \nthe scene name, top left\n• Rename, duplicate, delete\n• Local only: a scene that never leaves your \nbrowser",
      "fontSize": 34,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Every drawing is a scene with a name and its own address, like kurviq.com/roadmap.\n\n• Switch scenes in the Scenes sidebar: click the scene name, top left\n• Rename, duplicate, delete\n• Local only: a scene that never leaves your browser",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
