      "text": "Install Kurviq on a GitHub organization and \nits members share your-org/kurviq-scenes.\n\n• Switch spaces in the Scenes sidebar: your \nown, or an organization's\n• GitHub decides who may read or edit: no \nextra accounts, no invitations\n• Read access: view, present and copy\n• Removed on GitHub, removed in Kurviq",
