      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Install Kurviq on a GitHub organization and its members share your-org/kurviq-scenes.\n\n• Switch spaces in the Scenes sidebar: your own, or an organization's\n• GitHub decides who may read or edit: no extra accounts, no invitations\n• Read access: view, present and copy\n• Removed on GitHub, removed in Kurviq",
      "autoResize": false,
