      },
      "text": "Format parts of a text, like in a word \nprocessor.\n\n• While you edit a text, a toolbar appears \nabove it\n• The usual shortcuts work: ⌘B, ⌘I, ⌘U, \n⌘K …\n• Pasting from Google Docs or a web page \nkeeps bold, italic, links and lists",
      "fontSize": 34,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Format parts of a text, like in a word processor.\n\n• While you edit a text, a toolbar appears above it\n• The usual shortcuts work: ⌘B, ⌘I, ⌘U, ⌘K …\n• Pasting from Google Docs or a web page keeps bold, italic, links and lists",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
